{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37901","headline":"孤鴈 二 · 崔涂","name":"孤鴈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几行归去尽，片影独何之。\n暮雨相呼失，寒塘独下迟。\n渚云低暗度，关月冷遥随。\n未必逢矰缴，孤飞自可疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}